msgid "version"
msgstr "XXX_MODULE_VERSION_XXX"

msgid "shortDesc"
msgstr "The BlueOnyx AI Assistant provides an AI chat interface for server diagnostics, log analysis, and admin assistance."

msgid "longDesc"
msgstr "The BlueOnyx AI Assistant lets administrators query the system through chat and use built-in tools for common support work. It integrates with local or external LLMs, supports service and log inspection, incident timelines, SSL  and PHP-FPM health checks, Vsite health evidence, web-owner checks, memory/disk/network diagnostics, and controlled privileged actions through BlueOnyx-specific wrappers and policy."

